{"assets":["/statement-assets/a2f6b80eaba1e14c5bf0a453574e6202583083c46e2e48708b8ecb735c274999.png","/statement-assets/672ab0f38e3635b8983c837eeb04057a4ba7f60cc0a44a94fbde55d1882cb116.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1868","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Travel Plan"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"During the summer vacation after Zhongkao examination, Tom and Daniel are planning to go traveling."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ cities in their country, numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$. And the traffic system in the country is very special. For each city $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$), there is"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" a road between city $$$i$$$ and $$$2i$$$, if $$$2i\\le n$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" a road between city $$$i$$$ and $$$2i+1$$$, if $$$2i+1\\le n$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Making a travel plan, Daniel chooses some integer value between $$$1$$$ and $$$m$$$ for each city, for the $$$i$$$-th city we denote it by $$$a_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$s_{i,j}$$$ be the maximum value of cities in the simple$$$^\\dagger$$$ path between cities $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"score"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the travel plan is $$$\\sum_{i=1}^n\\sum_{j=i}^n s_{i,j}$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tom wants to know the sum of scores of all possible travel plans. Daniel asks you to help him find it. You just need to tell him the answer modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^\\dagger$$$ A simple path between cities $$$x$$$ and $$$y$$$ is a path between them that passes through each city at most once."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1\\le t\\le 200$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1\\leq n\\leq 10^{18}$$$, $$$1\\leq m\\leq 10^5$$$) — the number of the cities and the maximum value of a city."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$m$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case output one integer — the sum of scores of all possible travel plans, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n3 1\n2 2\n10 9\n43 20\n154 147\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n19\n583217643\n68816635\n714002110\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there is only one possible travel plan:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/a2f6b80eaba1e14c5bf0a453574e6202583083c46e2e48708b8ecb735c274999.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$1\\rightarrow 1$$$: $$$s_{1,1}=a_1=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$1\\rightarrow 2$$$: $$$s_{1,2}=\\max(1,1)=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$1\\rightarrow 3$$$: $$$s_{1,3}=\\max(1,1)=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$2\\rightarrow 2$$$: $$$s_{2,2}=a_2=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$2\\rightarrow 1\\rightarrow 3$$$: $$$s_{2,3}=\\max(1,1,1)=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Path $$$3\\rightarrow 3$$$: $$$s_{3,3}=a_3=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The score is $$$1+1+1+1+1+1=6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, there are four possible travel plans:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/672ab0f38e3635b8983c837eeb04057a4ba7f60cc0a44a94fbde55d1882cb116.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Score of plan $$$1$$$: $$$1+1+1=3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Score of plan $$$2$$$: $$$1+2+2=5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Score of plan $$$3$$$: $$$2+2+1=5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Score of plan $$$4$$$: $$$2+2+2=6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Therefore, the sum of score is $$$3+5+5+6=19$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1868C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1868/problem/C"}